1) WEBSCRAPING
For the WTO news and press releases, the database is: https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news_e.htm
To scrape the link for each webpage, we used WTO_scraping.R

2) SENTIMENT ANALYSIS
After the content is downloaded to each text file, the sentiments using finBERT algorithm is applied using Python file: finBERT_withfolders.py


3) WORD CLOUD VISUALIZATION
Using the content of UN statements, wordcloud.R file is used to visualize word cloud.


